<title>USA: Ambac qualifies nine issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>Ambac qualifies nine issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambac Assurance Corp. said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following nine municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Pomona USD, Calif., $10 million GOs.</p>
<p>--San Leandro USD, Calif., $15.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Rockaway Twp, N.J., $3.3 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Tarrytown UFSD, N.Y., school district.</p>
<p>--Arlington, Texas, $6.9 million combination purpose and $33.99 million improvement .</p>
<p>--Loudoun County, Va., $44.325 million public improvememt GOs.</p>
<p>-Tacoma, Wash., $29.78 million limited tax GOs and $3 million GO and refunding (tax).  </p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
